  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project aims to contribute to the consolidation of decentralization and local governance through support in strengthening the oversight capacity of Members of the Provincial Assemblies and strengthening the capacity of local governance structures. Also the promotion and strengthening the capacity of Civil Society Organizations to monitor the implementation of the local government plans, through the consolidation of a sustainable platform for dialogue.
DCAD support will reinforce inclusive dialogue platforms at various levels between different actors interested in the decentralization process.</narrative>
